          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Yerusalemu, Yerusalemu, iwe owiranga abanabii nobalasa namachina abo abakhurumilwa! Nakhandi akhanji nimbeelenje ninzenya okhukhung'aasia abaanabo halala, shinga inyafusi olwa yikhung'aasia ebimiinywi biayo mumbaha tsiayo; ne shimwafuchiilila ta! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lole, inzu yeenywe yimulesheelwe niyili likunda; nasi emusunjila mbu shimulindolakhwo khandi ta okhuula olwa muliboola mbu Owitsa muliira liOmwami yeetsoomibwe!",
          "type": "text",
